      "heading": "Workspace Behavior Threshold",
      "id": "behavior-threshold",
      "intro": "Tab **Behavior Threshold** adalah workspace untuk mengkonfigurasi parameter ambang batas sinyal perilaku pengguna di perangkat. Setiap threshold memiliki Key (identifier unik), Threshold Value (nilai numerik yang dapat diubah), dan Rule Status (read-only dari database). Tersedia juga tombol **Refresh Cache** untuk memuat ulang data threshold dari cache server.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "List Panel: Memilih Behavior Threshold & Pencarian",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **List Panel (lebar 280px)** di sisi kiri menampilkan semua behavior threshold yang tersedia.\n• **Search Bar**: Input pencarian di bagian atas list untuk memfilter threshold berdasarkan **Key** atau **Description** secara real-time (instant filter, tanpa tombol apply).\n• Setiap item ditampilkan dengan **Key** dalam huruf kapital. Contoh key:\n  - `TYPING_SPEED_MS` — kecepatan mengetik (milisecond)\n  - `TOUCH_PRESSURE_MIN` — tekanan sentuh minimum\n  - `MAX_ACTIONS_COUNT` — jumlah aksi maksimum\n  - `SESSION_DURATION_SECONDS` — durasi sesi\n• Item dengan status **Inactive** ditampilkan dengan badge merah \"Inactive\" di bawah Key-nya.\n• Item aktif ditandai dengan border mainColor dan ikon chevron di kanan.\n• Bagian bawah list menampilkan total item yang tersaring.",
          "color": "#4f46e5",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(79,70,229,.1);border:1px solid #e0e7ff;background:#fff;width:200px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Behavior Thresholds</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:1px;\">Device behavior signals</div></div><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#ede9fe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4f46e5\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M22 3H2l8 9.46V19l4 2v-8.54L22 3z\"/></svg></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px;\"><div style=\"position:relative;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:7px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">🔍</span><input placeholder=\"Search key...\" style=\"width:100%;padding:5px 5px 5px 22px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:6px;font-size:9px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#f8f9fa;\"/></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;\"><div style=\"border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #4f46e5;background:rgba(79,70,229,.06);display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:4px;background:#4f46e5;\"></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Key</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:900;color:#4f46e5;margin-top:3px;text-transform:uppercase;\">TYPING_SPEED_MS</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 6px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4f46e5\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M9 18l6-6-6-6\"/></svg></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:4px;background:#d9e1ea;\"></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Key</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-top:3px;text-transform:uppercase;\">TOUCH_PRESSURE_MIN</div></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:4px;background:#d9e1ea;\"></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Key</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-top:3px;text-transform:uppercase;\">MAX_ACTIONS_COUNT</div><span style=\"padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#fee2e2;font-size:7.5px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;display:inline-block;margin-top:3px;\">Inactive</span></div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#94a3b8;\">Total</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">3</span></div></div>"
          }
