        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Edit Panel: Mengubah Threshold Value & Refresh Cache",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:2}\n• **Edit Panel** di kanan menampilkan form \"General settings\" untuk threshold yang dipilih.\n• **Key** (read-only): Identifier unik threshold, tidak dapat diubah dari UI. Ditampilkan dengan background abu-abu dan cursor `not-allowed`.\n• **Threshold Value** (editable): Input numerik untuk nilai ambang batas. Satuan dan tipe input menyesuaikan Key secara otomatis:\n  - Key berakhiran `_MS` → suffix ` ms`, step 1\n  - Key berakhiran `_SECONDS` → suffix ` seconds`, step 1\n  - Key berakhiran `_COUNT` atau `_ACTIONS` → integer tanpa suffix\n  - Key `TOUCH_PRESSURE_*` → desimal 2 angka, step 0.01\n• **Rule Status** (read-only): Toggle switch menampilkan status Active/Inactive tapi tidak bisa diubah dari UI — hanya bisa diubah dari database.\n• **Tombol Refresh Cache** (di header workspace): Klik untuk me-refresh data threshold dari cache server. Useful setelah perubahan dilakukan di luar UI.\n• **Cancel / Update**: Tombol Cancel reset perubahan, Update submit nilai threshold baru ke server.",
          "color": "#4f46e5",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "2": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(79,70,229,.1);border:1px solid #e0e7ff;background:#fff;max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Behavior Threshold Workspace</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:1px;\">Configure device behavior parameters.</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:5px;\"><button style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#ede9fe;border:none;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#4f46e5;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4f46e5\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"23 4 23 10 17 10\"/><path d=\"M20.49 15a9 9 0 1 1-2.12-9.36L23 10\"/></svg>Refresh Cache</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:8px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;align-items:start;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Key</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:2px;\">Unique identifier key.</div></div><input value=\"TYPING_SPEED_MS\" readOnly style=\"padding:5px 9px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:6px;font-size:9px;color:#6b7280;background:#f9fafb;cursor:not-allowed;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\"/></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:8px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;align-items:start;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Threshold Value</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:2px;\">Minimum typing interval in ms.</div></div><div style=\"position:relative;\"><input value=\"150\" style=\"padding:5px 30px 5px 9px;border:1.5px solid #4f46e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:9.5px;color:#0f172a;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\"/><span style=\"position:absolute;right:8px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">ms</span></div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:8px;padding:10px 0;align-items:start;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Rule status</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:2px;\">Managed from database only.</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"width:32px;height:18px;border-radius:12px;background:#4f46e5;position:relative;cursor:not-allowed;\"><div style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;position:absolute;top:2px;right:2px;\"></div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#dcfce7;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">Active</span></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:5px;\"><button style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#4f46e5;border:none;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">Update</button></div></div>"
          }
